WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.040
&gt;&gt; A VETERAN RUSSIAN DIPLOMAT
WHO PRESIDED IT MAY, PROTESTING

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:11.043
WHAT HE CALLS MOSCOW'S
AGGRESSIVE WAR AGAINST UKRAINE,

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:13.980
OF COURSE VLADIMIR PUTIN CALLS
A SPECIAL OPERATION.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.984
BORIS BONDAREV WAS POSTED TO
RUSSIA'S MISSION TO THE UNITED

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:21.921
NATIONS IN GENEVA, AND IN A
STATEMENT ON LINKEDIN, HE WROTE,

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:25.625
QUOTE, THE AGGRESSIVE WAR
UNLEASHED ON BY PUTIN ON

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.694
UKRAINE AND OF COURSE BY THE
ENTIRE WESTERN WORLD IS NOT

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:32.165
ONLY A CRIME AGAINST UKRAINIAN
PEOPLE, BUT ALSO PERHAPS THE

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:36.002
MOST SERIOUS CRIME AGAINST THE
PEOPLE OF RUSSIA.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.338
BORIS BONDAREV JOINS ME NOW THE
ESCAPE.

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.839
IT'S GOOD TO HAVE YOU.
THANK.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:45.245
YOU EXPAND ON THAT IF YOU WILL.
WHY DID YOU RESIGN IN FEBRUARY?

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.180
AND WHAT DID YOU MEAN IN WHAT
YOU WROTE?

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:55.855
&gt;&gt; GOOD AFTERNOON.
WELL, IN SHORT, I RESIGNED

00:00:55.855 --> 00:01:00.860
BECAUSE ON FEBRUARY 24TH THIS
YEAR, MY COUNTRY ATTACKED

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:07.000
UKRAINE, OUR NEIGHBOR COUNTRY,
I WOULD SAY OUR BROTHER COUNTRY.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.669
ALWAYS THOUGHT ABOUT IT, MOST
RUSSIANS.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:16.042
THAT WAS A THRESHOLD FOR ME.
I REALIZE THAT I CANNOT ANY

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.311
LONGER STAY IN THE CIVIL
SERVICE.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:23.683
I CANNOT ANY LONGER PROTECT
THIS, YOU KNOW, THIS WAR.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:32.258
I ENDURED FOR THIS --
I DID NOT LIKE WHAT WAS GOING

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.228
ON.
I TOLD MYSELF EVERY TIME THAT,

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:38.331
OKAY, AS FAR AS THERE IS NO
VIOLENCE, AS FAR AS THERE IS NO

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:40.900
WAR, I CAN PUT UP WITH IT.
THE WAR IS SOMETHING TOTALLY

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.470
DIFFERENT.
&gt;&gt; WERE YOU SHOCKED?

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.075
I'M INTERESTED TO HEAR IF YOU
WERE SHOCKED BY PUTIN'S

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:53.646
DECISION ON FEBRUARY 23RD, 24
TO INVADE.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:02:01.588
OR WAS IT TELEGRAPHED TO YOU AS
AN AMBASSADOR, SOMEONE WHO

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:13.166
WOULD HAVE TO DEAL WITH THIS?
&gt;&gt; NO, OF COURSE IT WAS NOT,

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:16.269
BECAUSE THIS DECISION WAS
EVIDENTLY TAKEN IN THE

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:20.640
ATMOSPHERE OF HIGH SECRECY.
EVEN OUR MILITARY, WE WERE

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.477
STATIONED ALONG UKRAINE BORDER,
WE DID NOT KNOW UNTIL THE VERY

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:29.215
DAY OF THE ATTACK ABOUT THAT
THAT WE WOULD BE ATTACKING

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.317
UKRAINE.
OF COURSE, IT WAS A SHOCK FOR

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:36.222
ME, AND SO MANY PEOPLE WHO
STAYED IN THE UNITED STATES

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.225
INTELLIGENCE, WE SAID THE
INVASION WAS IMMINENT, YET I

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:41.561
DID NOT BELIEVE THAT PUTIN
WOULD DO THAT.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:46.332
BECAUSE WE ALL OF THE PROBLEMS,
THE THEY HAVE CONSEQUENCES

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:52.605
WHICH WE WOULD ASSUME --
I DID NOT SEE ANY BENEFIT THAT

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:55.208
RUSSIA COULD GET FROM THAT.
I DID NOT BELIEVE IT AT THE

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.476
TIME.
OF COURSE, I WAS SHOCKED BY THE

00:02:56.476 --> 00:03:01.114
INVASION.
&gt;&gt; AND SEVEN AND A HALF MONTHS

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:06.719
IN, AND WITH THE LATEST NEWS
THAT PRESIDENT PUTIN HAS

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:11.090
ANNEXED, THESE FOUR REGIONS,
YOU MUST HAVE BEEN WATCHING

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:15.295
THAT VERY ELABORATE CEREMONY AT
ST. GEORGES HALL IN THE KREMLIN

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:18.164
ON FRIDAY.
WHAT WAS GOING THROUGH YOUR

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:22.468
MIND, WHAT WAS HIS STRATEGY
HERE?

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:31.844
&gt;&gt; WELL, THIS SPEECH WAS, IT
WAS A COMPILATION OF ALL OF THE

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:35.214
CONSPIRACIES THAT WE CAN NOW,
IT COULD NOW BE FOUNDED IN

00:03:35.214 --> 00:03:40.052
THEIR RUSSIAN SOCIETY.
IT IS ABOUT THIS WESTERN,

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:43.122
DETERMINATION TO DISMANTLE AND
DESTROY RUSSIA, AND SO ON.

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:48.661
EIGHT IS ALL, NOTHING TO DO
WITH REALITY.

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:55.101
AND YOU KNOW, TO WATCH THE
SPEECH, IT WAS VERY PAINFUL.

00:03:55.101 --> 00:04:02.174
FOR ANY INTELLIGENT PERSON.
WITH THE STRATEGY --

00:04:02.174 --> 00:04:06.279
WHAT IT'S TRYING TO PROMOTE, I
DON'T THINK IT HAS A NEW

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:09.115
STRATEGY.
BECAUSE THE ONLY STRATEGY HE

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:15.154
HAD WAS TO OCCUPY ALL OF
UKRAINE IN THE NEXT FEW DAYS.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:19.292
AND THEN THIS, FROM THE
POSITION OF STRENGTH, POSITION

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:23.229
OF CONQUER.
SINCE HE APPEALED IT BACK, NOW

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:27.133
THESE TRADITIONS, SO TO SPEAK,
IS TO FIND A WAY TO GET OUT OF

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:29.435
THIS POSITION.
AND HIS SITUATION IS GROWING

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:33.373
WORSE AND WORSE EVERY DAY.
OVER THE WEEK AND, PUTIN ALLY

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:37.310
AND LEADER OF THE CHECHEN
REPUBLIC --

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.113
PAD YOUR OFF CALLED ON LATTIMER
POND TO TAKE MORE DRASTIC

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:43.049
MEASURES.
INCLUDING THE USE OF LOW YIELD

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:49.088
TACTICAL NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
GIVEN HIS RECENT LOSSES ON THE

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:53.326
BATTLEFIELD, DO YOU BELIEVE
VLADIMIR PUTIN COULD, WOULD,

00:04:53.326 --> 00:05:01.067
WILL, ACTUALLY, RESORT TO THE
USE OF THESE SORT OF NUCLEAR

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.668
TACTICAL WEAPONS?
OR WORSE, AT THIS POINT.

00:05:02.668 --> 00:05:13.913
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THAT HE MAY TRY TO
DO SO IF HE FEELS THAT HE IS

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:16.349
FULLY CORNERED.
THAT HE HAS NO WAY OUT.

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:24.924
AND I THINK IF UKRAINE IS TO
CONTINUE THEIR MARCH TOWARDS

00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:27.527
TEMPORARILY OPTICAL --
OCCUPIED LANDS AND I THINK THAT

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:30.430
MR. PUTIN WILL FEEL THIS VERY
SOON.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:35.268
AND --
BUT FOR NOW I DON'T THINK THAT

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:40.406
THE RECORD OF HIS USING NUCLEAR
WEAPONS FOR TODAY IS QUITE

00:05:40.406 --> 00:05:42.341
HIGH.
I DON'T THINK IT'S HIGH, BUT IT

00:05:42.341 --> 00:05:48.481
MAY BE HIGHER.
IT WILL ALL DEPEND ON THE

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:53.886
COURSE OF THE WAR.
AND IF THE NEWLY POPULARIZED,

00:05:53.886 --> 00:06:01.494
SO TO SPEAK, ARMY TARA, IS TO
CRUMBLE AFTER A FEW SERIOUS

00:06:01.494 --> 00:06:05.898
BLOWS FROM UKRAINE.
AND THEN WE'VE HEARD THAT THERE

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:10.503
ARE MANY PEOPLE WHO SURRENDERED
AND MANY PEOPLE WHO DROP THEIR

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:13.973
GUNS AND FLEE FROM THE
BATTLEFIELD, THIS RUSSIAN ARMY

00:06:13.973 --> 00:06:19.745
MAY STOP ITS ATTACK SOON.
THEN I THINK THAT MAYBE NO ONE

00:06:19.745 --> 00:06:25.451
WILL BE THERE TO EXECUTE THESE
ORDERS IF THE ORDERS WILL COME

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:28.754
FROM PUTIN.
AND I THINK OF THE RUSSIAN ARMY

00:06:28.754 --> 00:06:36.496
WILL BE DEFEATED BY UKRAINIANS,
THEN PUTIN MAY FACE SOME

00:06:36.496 --> 00:06:39.699
OPPOSITION WITHIN HIS OWN INNER
CIRCLE.

00:06:39.699 --> 00:06:44.937
SO HE MAY EVEN NOT HAVE
SUFFICIENT TIME TO RESORT TO

00:06:44.937 --> 00:06:46.839
NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
THAT IS MY HOPE.

00:06:46.839 --> 00:06:51.511
&gt;&gt; THAT'S FASCINATING.
HE USED HIS SPEECH ON FRIDAY TO

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:58.751
JUSTIFY THE WAR WALTZED CALLING
FOR A CEASE-FIRE OR A PATH TO

00:06:58.751 --> 00:07:02.054
PEACE.
DO YOU GENUINELY BELIEVE THAT

00:07:02.054 --> 00:07:05.992
HE WANTS TO ISSUE PEACE AT THIS
POINT?

00:07:05.992 --> 00:07:10.696
AND, SHOULD, GIVEN THE POSITION
ON THE BATTLEFIELD, AND

00:07:10.696 --> 00:07:15.835
VLADIMIR PUTIN'S MOVES TO
ILLEGALLY ANNEXED PARTS OF

00:07:15.835 --> 00:07:21.774
UKRAINE.
SHOULD UKRAINE AND THE WEST

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:23.309
PURSUE HIM, HIS CAUSE FOR PEACE
AT THIS POINT?

00:07:23.309 --> 00:07:33.085
&gt;&gt; WELL, I BELIEVE THAT BY
PIECE MR. PUTIN UNDERSTANDS

00:07:33.085 --> 00:07:38.424
PEAS ON HIS OWN TERMS.
AND THOSE ARE LIKE UKRAINIAN --

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:40.793
SO TO SPEAK, FOR UKRAINE TO
SURRENDER TO RUSSIA.

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:46.532
BUT PUTIN WILL NOT GIVE UP HIS
NEWLY OCCUPIED TERRITORIES.

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:49.435
IT WOULD MEAN UKRAINE LOST THE
WAR.

00:07:49.435 --> 00:07:53.005
AND WITH THAT, THE WESTERN
COUNTRY, NATO WILL BE

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:55.575
HUMILIATED.
WHICH IS ANOTHER GOAL FOR MR.

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:58.978
PUTIN.
AND THEN, THE GLOBAL POLITICAL

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:01.414
LANDSCAPE OF THE PLANET WILL
CHANGE VERY SIGNIFICANTLY.

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:08.020
I DON'T THINK THAT THAT'S THE
OUTCOME THE WESTERN COUNTRIES

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.355
SHORT STRIVE FOR.
&gt;&gt; RIGHT --

00:08:09.355 --> 00:08:12.325
SO, CAN I ASK YOU --
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:08:12.325 --> 00:08:15.661
&gt;&gt; I'D LIKE TO ASK YOU, BECAUSE
OF OUR BREAKING NEWS, I WILL

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:18.297
HAVE TO LEAVE THIS, BUT I JUST
NEED TO ASK YOU THIS ONE

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:19.632
QUESTION.
DO YOU BELIEVE THAT VLADIMIR

00:08:19.632 --> 00:08:20.833
PUTIN IS VULNERABLE AT THIS
POINT?

00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:32.812
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THAT AT THIS POINT
HIS POSITION, IN RUSSIA, IS

00:08:32.812 --> 00:08:37.049
WEAKER THAN IT WAS BEFORE.
AND HE GETS WEAKER EVERY DAY.

00:08:37.049 --> 00:08:43.089
BUT I DON'T SAY THAT WE SHOULD
WAIT SOME LIKE COUP OR

00:08:43.089 --> 00:08:45.524
SOMETHING LIKE THIS IN THE NEAR
FUTURE.

00:08:45.524 --> 00:08:49.161
IT IS NOT A MATTER OF WEEKS.
I THINK IT IS A MATTER OF

00:08:49.161 --> 00:08:50.196
MONTHS, RATHER.

